\section*{Key equations (hand-transcribed to LaTeX from the PDF)}

Model Hamiltonian (Eq. 1):
$$ H = -J_1 \sum_{\langle ij\rangle} \mathbf{S}_i\cdot\mathbf{S}_j + J_2 \sum_{\langle\langle ij\rangle\rangle} \mathbf{S}_i\cdot\mathbf{S}_j - K \sum_{\langle ij\rangle} S_i^z S_j^z - B \sum_i S_i^z $$

In-plane skyrmion angle (Eq. 2): $\varphi_s(x)=\sigma\,\varphi(x)+\varphi_0,\ \sigma=\pm1$.

Binding / stability against quantum evaporation (Eq. ~4-5):
$$ E_0^B(N_f) = E_0(N_f) - N_f\, e_1, \qquad e_1 = E(1\text{ magnon}) - E_{\mathrm{FM}} $$
with \$E_0^B(N_f)<0\$ for \$N_f\ge2\$ signalling a many-magnon bound state (the quantum skyrmion).

Winding-correlation (Eq. 12): winding number detected from the arctan of transverse
spin-spin correlation functions (real-space texture), not from raw scalar chirality.

